{"title": "第七章", "index": 1449, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"IEAC60-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<div class=\"calibre15\" id=\"chapter\">\n<p class=\"calibre12\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">天长地久，天地所以能长且久者，以其不自生，故能长生。是以圣人后其身而身先，外其身而身存。非以其无私邪？故能成其私。</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}